		<title>Kitten Adoption Day</title>
		<link>http://themes.webdevia.com/voip-wordpress-theme/event/kitten-adoption-day/</link>
		<pubDate>Tue, 20 Dec 2016 12:38:32 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[root]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://themes.webdevia.com/voip-wordpress-theme/?post_type=tribe_events&#038;p=2349</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[I've done everything the Bible says — even the stuff that contradicts the other stuff! Our differences are only skin deep, but our sames go down to the bone. And now, in the spirit of the season: start shopping. And for every dollar of Krusty merchandise you buy, I will be nice to a sick kid. For legal purposes, sick kids may include hookers with a cold. And here I am using my own lungs like a sucker. What good is money if it can't inspire terror in your fellow man? Homer no function beer well without.
	
]]></content:encoded>
